<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following major South African economic indicators are scheduled for release next week:</p>
<p>DAY    GMT   INDICATOR    PERIOD  FORECAST   RANGE	PREVIOUS</p>
<p>MON+	   TRADE	  OCT     +0.9BLN    0.8/1.2BLN +0.67BLN</p>
<p>THURS  0900  GDP	    Q3	2.5 PCT    1.0/3.5     3.5</p>
<p>FRI    1500  M3	     OCT    15.1 PCT   14.1/15.5   14.45</p>
<p>FRI    1500  PRIV.CREDIT  OCT    18.1 PCT   17.7/18.6   17.94</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
